    {
      "start": 0.08,
      "end": 4.475,
      "text": "Spacecraft never dodge giant rocks while crossing the asteroid belt.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Date- Dec 1972 Pioneer 10 Artwork Spacecraft shown only 11 hours after launch passing the orbit of the Moon in this artist concept on it's way to orbit above Jupiter's surface (used in NASA SP-349) (ARC-1969-AC72-1353).jpg",
