        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Date-_Dec_1972_Pioneer_10_Artwork_Spacecraft_shown_only_11_hours_after_launch_passing_the_orbit_of_the_Moon_in_this_artist_concept_on_it%27s_way_to_orbit_above_Jupiter%27s_surface_(used_in_NASA_SP-349)_(ARC-1969-AC72-1353).jpg"
      },
